   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We invested $4 million in Curebay Technologies Pvt Ltd (Curebay), a rural healthcare platform in India, through an equity co-investment alongside Elevar V, managed by Elevar. Curebay operates a &#xfffd;phygital&#xfffd; model, combining physical clinics with digital services to deliver affordable, quality healthcare across underserved regions.The platform offers end-to-end care including doctor consultations and diagnostics as well as pharmacy services and referrals for specialist treatment. Patients are supported throughout their journey, including transport, post-operative care, and access to government health schemes.Curebay has built a scalable network of over 150 e-clinics across Odisha and Chhattisgarh, currently serving around 336,000 active patients and reaching approximately 1.8 million people.</narrative>
   </description>
